      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Hey. ::wheeze::

::His breath smells like brew that had been fermented in dirty socks.:: 

&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Гей. ::Хрип::

::З його рота пахне настояним у брудних шкарпетках пивом.:: 

&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q10" name="=&gt;q10">
