    <unit id="=&gt;a12" name="=&gt;a12">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">24</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Let me take a look at what you've got. ::Barter.::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Дайте мені подивитися, що у вас є. ::Обмін.::&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a13" name="=&gt;a13">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">26</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>What've you got here? I'm feeling hungry.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Що у вас тут є? Я відчуваю голод.&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q14" name="=&gt;q14">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">28</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Well... I got the stew, nice and warm, but I don't know if ya can stomach it. ::wheeze:: It's in this barrel here, look. ::He points to a barrel that is being orbited by flies.:: That. If ya wanna try it, be my guest. Just don't come complainin' if ya die.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Ну... у мене є тушковане м'ясо, тепле, але я не знаю, чи зможете ви його з'їсти. ::Хрип:: Воно в цій бочці, дивіться. ::Він показує на бочку, навколо якої кружляють мухи.:: Та. Якщо хочете спробувати, будь ласка. Просто не приходьте скаржитися, якщо помрете.&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q15" name="=&gt;q15">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">30</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>But other than that I got fish, mushrooms... some old canned food. Stuff like that. ::wheeze:: 

Interested in anythin'? ::wheeze::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Але крім цього у мене є риба, гриби... трохи старого консервованого корму. Щось таке. ::Хрип:: 

Зацікавлені в чомусь? ::Хрип::&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a16" name="=&gt;a16">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">32</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Can I ask you a few questions?&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Чи можу я поставити вам кілька запитань?&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q17" name="=&gt;q17">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">34</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>No. Ain'tcha supposed to be doin' something else, hm? ::wheeze::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Ні. Вам не слід займатися чимось іншим, хіба ні? ::Хрип::&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q18" name="=&gt;q18">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">36</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Yeah. You know it. ::wheeze:: Bye.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Так. Ти знаєш. ::Хрип:: До побачення.&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q19" name="=&gt;q19">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">38</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>It about grub or... ::wheeze:: *other* things?&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Це про їжу чи... ::Хрип:: *інше*?&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a20" name="=&gt;a20">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">40</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Yes, it's about food.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Так, це про їжу.&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q21" name="=&gt;q21">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">42</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Ah, that's good then. ::wheeze:: Go ahead.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">А, добре. ::Хрип:: Заходьте.&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a22" name="=&gt;a22">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">44</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Other things.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Інше.&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q23" name="=&gt;q23">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">46</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Then no. ::wheeze:: I ain't got no time for muckin' about with other things, and ya look like a person that's got loads of questions. ::wheeze::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Тоді ні. ::Хрип:: У мене немає часу на маячню з іншими речами, і ти виглядаєш як людина, у якої купа запитань. ::Хрип::&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q24" name="=&gt;q24">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">48</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>It's grub or nothin'. ::wheeze::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Це їжа або нічого. ::Хрип::&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a25" name="=&gt;a25">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">50</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>I better get going.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Мені краще йти.&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q26" name="=&gt;q26">
